    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cactus Simulator Remake is a game in which you can become a cactus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game engine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved optimization</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved settings menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful stylized graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 playable characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game mods: arcade and realistic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic change of day and night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10\u00a0localizations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Canonical Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a cactus </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in the desert </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other cacti around you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not only cacti</p></li></ul>",
